    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. I will import the necessary module from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Comprehend client to detect toxic content. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Amazon Comprehend client. </thinking>\n",
